."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_20Winter_Drink_Tea","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"After licking the salt, she knocks back the tequila."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ah—Fantastic!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_20Winter_Door_Car_Close","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Maggie lets out a long sigh, then slumps into the table head-first."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_20Winter_Bar_Cheering_V2","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The barkeeper keeps polishing his wine glasses while the other customers keep chattering loudly about nothing in particular. Nobody pays any attention to a Doll getting drunk here. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"After all, this is a bar. Such places have no shortages of drunkards."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"sfx","value":"Stop_AVG_loop","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"527","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":true,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"\"Colt Express\", inside Maggie's neural space."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"GF_2022_Summer_AVG_1","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Gaslights, oil paintings, a wooden table—this place is a practically perfect recreation of a western locomotive from the last century. Even the view outside the window shows a savannah at night stretching as far as the eye can see. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If there were any real cowboys left, they would feel right at home on board the Colt Express. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"That's right, it's even named after the most beloved revolver of all cowboys."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Something seems to be missing."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_20Winter_Whistle","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Maggie snaps her fingers, and a glass of whiskey appears on the table as an apéritif."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Mhmm, now we're talking. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Let's get to work, Catherine, Quimby."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Scalper","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_tele_connect","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Catherine","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hold on, Maggie. Where did you leave your body? At that bar?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Scalper","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yeah, there's so much to do, I couldn't wait for you to get here."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Scalper","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Catherine","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You may be a regular at the bar... but it doesn't feel very safe leaving your body unguarded...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Scalper","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrat