 attitude, Catherine. Whoever gives us money is our boss. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Fend him off using my comms. Make some conversation and try to change the subject. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Oh, and don't accept any invitations to balls or parties. Right now, every minute wasted is money wasted."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Scalper","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}},{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Catherine","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Right, I'll do my best.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"ColtWalker","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Quimby, keep working."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Quimby","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Quimby","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yes, ma'am.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-NervousMan","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Nikolai","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Maggie?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Scalper","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Maggie","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I was just checking our accounts.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You should've asked earlier. We just finished putting our books in order this month. We'd have to start all over again if we made any changes.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-NervousMan","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Nikolai","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Then just shift some funds from someone else. It's an emergency.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"